  "body": "Quality-built by Universal Homes just under 10 years ago - this one is not like the others.\r\nYou say townhouse... we say large family home.\r\n\r\nWhere else can you get 2.7m stud heights, dual decks, stunning views and a rare large lawn for kids, pets or the boat?\r\nFancy a walk to the local restaurant for dinner? 5 minutes walk.\r\nNeed to get milk for the kids cereal? 5 minutes walk.\r\nLate for school? Not possible when it's just over the back fence\r\n\r\nWell loved by this family from new it is now time to say goodbye - the kids have left home, and now it's mums turn to have a life change.\r\nLocated in one of Auckland's most sought-after coastal communities, this is your opportunity to enjoy the ultimate Long Bay lifestyle.",
